  "description": "A neutral .NET API over Google Play Age Signals (Android) and Apple's Declared Age Range (iOS): the age range the platform shares, requestAgeRange, isEligibleForAgeFeatures, requiredRegulatoryFeatures and showSignificantUpdateAcknowledgment, plus a minimal local decision log that keeps five fields. Off by default. It supplies a platform signal and a log; it does not make an app compliant with any law and is not legal advice.",
